WEBVTT

00:15:55.079 --> 00:16:00.162
That was the payment for a broken
back back in 1980 or so.

00:16:00.537 --> 00:16:02.454
And my mom said, you know,

00:16:02.454 --> 00:16:06.871
this is our only chance we'll ever
have our own home that we own

00:16:07.371 --> 00:16:11.371
and let's not buy a home. Let's buy land.
So they went to northern Minnesota.

00:16:11.371 --> 00:16:13.412
Yeah. And we moved to 40 acres of land.

00:16:13.537 --> 00:16:16.329
We lived really in a tarpaper shack,

00:16:16.871 --> 00:16:21.746
one room tarpaper shack for the first six
months. And we built the house ourselves.

00:16:22.371 --> 00:16:26.454
And it was a lot of work and it
was incredibly difficult.

00:16:26.912 --> 00:16:32.912
And I was a teenager and I wanted
to be pretty and popular